  "review_notes": [
    "Capability helpers centralize role checks and normalize the legacy PLATFORM_AUTHOR token to ACADEMIC_STAFF at the shared session boundary.",
    "Admin navigation and page guards separate platform operations, academic authoring/review, and platform-admin-only settings/user-management capabilities; host navigation remains unchanged.",
    "Platform user management uses a dedicated API surface with role/status server-side filtering, safe assignable-role options, confirmation states, self/admin target protection, and mutation error handling.",
